<title>LATVIA: RIGAS KOMERCBANKA OFFERS SALARY PAYMENTS ON CARDS.</title>
<headline>RIGAS KOMERCBANKA OFFERS SALARY PAYMENTS ON CARDS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rigas komercbanka, the third biggest bank in Latvia by way of assets, said on Tuesday it had introduced a service of salary payments via bank cards.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement it offers the service for VISA-Electron and edc-CIRRUS/MAESTRO card holders.</p>
<p>The cards can be used for witdrawing cash from teller-machines and as a means of payment.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
